    "会分析相册里的全部照片。分析结果存在本机，下次打开只分析新拍的或编辑过的照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every photo in your library is analyzed. Results are saved on this device, so next time only new or edited photos are analyzed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会用流量和电量，建议连着 Wi-Fi": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses data and battery — Wi-Fi recommended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低质量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
