    "你之前拒绝了相册权限，请到「设置」里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photo access was denied. Please turn it on in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你只授权了部分照片，只能清理这些照片。可到「设置 › 隐私 › 照片」改为「完全访问」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've only allowed access to some photos, so only those can be cleaned. Change it to Full Access in Settings › Privacy › Photos."
