    "其中 %lld 张是收藏，不会被标记。标记后还要在「清理」页确认，系统也会再问一次才真正删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld of them are favorites and won't be marked. You'll still confirm on the Clean tab, and the system asks once more before anything is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
