    "向左滑标记删除，向右滑保留，向上滑稍后再看。也可以用操作菜单。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left to mark for deletion, right to keep, up to review later. You can also use the actions menu."
